msgid "This is a maintenance release. Changes:"
msgstr "Nameščena je vzdrževalna različica s spremembami:"

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:53
msgid "Translate gpaste-client"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:54
msgid "Fix several crashes and freezes of the daemon"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:55
msgid "Fix items vanishing from the history, or being listed twice"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:56
msgid ""
"Fix copied spreadsheet cells, images and accented text being recorded wrong"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:57
msgid "Fix history names and backups reaching or overwriting the wrong files"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:58
msgid "Fix a damaged history's text being logged to the system journal"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:59
msgid "Fix searches missing items with special characters or capital letters"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:60
msgid "Fix keyboard shortcuts not working when the portal starts after GPaste"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:61
msgid ""
"Fix several issues in the graphical tool, the preferences and the overview's "
"search"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:62
msgid ""
"Fix gpaste-client mishandling piped input, unusual text and terminal output"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:63
msgid "Fix gpaste-client acting on the wrong item, process or file"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:64
msgid "Fix the bash completion and the help for backup-history"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:70
msgid ""
"This release adds a setting to disable the global keyboard shortcuts. "
"Changes:"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:72
msgid "New setting to disable the global keyboard shortcuts entirely"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:73
msgid ""
"Fix gnome-shell being left holding GPaste's grabs for the rest of the "
"session, and GPaste giving up on them for good after a slow login"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:74
msgid ""
"Fix the daemon crashing on a shortcut activation arriving after its gnome-"
"shell client was disposed"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:75
msgid ""
"Fix the global shortcuts under the portal: an edited accelerator never "
"reached it, Super went out under a name it doesn't know, and a dismissed "
"permission dialog was reported as a successful bind"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:76
msgid ""
"Fix the behaviour, images and history preferences pages acting on a settings "
"change before their rows exist"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:84
msgid ""
"Fix the daemon crashing when copying files right after copying anything else"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:85
msgid "Fix a memory leak on every clipboard read involving files"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:86
#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:204
msgid ""
"Fix \"gpaste-client\" exiting silently with status 255, instead of showing "
"its usage, on an unknown command or a wrong number of arguments"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:94
msgid ""
"Fix selecting a history in the UI sidebar doing nothing, and, when a "
"history's context menu was open, switching to that one instead of the one "
"clicked"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:102
msgid ""
"Fix the daemon deadlocking against itself when copying, most often on larger "
"items (text selections are now served by a dedicated content provider "
"instead of being serialized by GTK)"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:103
msgid ""
"text/plain is now served as UTF-8, where GTK's serializer encoded it as "
"ASCII and replaced anything else with '?'"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:104
msgid "Fix a deadlock when selecting an item that turns out to be invalid"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:105
#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:212
msgid ""
"Fix the daemon crashing when searching from the GNOME Shell overview with a "
"term containing an unbalanced bracket or parenthesis"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:106
#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:213
msgid ""
"Fix the history file being destroyed when it had been written by a newer "
"version of GPaste"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:107
#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:214
msgid ""
"Fix items being lost or garbled when loading a history containing an item "
"with an empty value"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:108
#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:215
msgid ""
"Fix every client crashing, GNOME Shell included, on the first update sent by "
"a newer daemon after \"gpaste-client daemon-reexec\""
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:109
#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:216
msgid ""
"Fix the daemon aborting, instead of disabling search, when it cannot connect "
"to its own D-Bus proxy"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/org.gnome.GPaste.Ui.metainfo.xml.in:110
